  },
  "question": {
    "text": "A ball is thrown horizontally from a height&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi></math> above a staircase as shown in the figure. If the coefficient of restitution for any collision between the ball and the staircase is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>e</mi></math>, then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi></math>&nbsp;for which the ball will bounce the same height above each step, is<br />\r<br />\r<img src=\"assets\\qt0043_587bc2fc271f.jpg\" />"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\qt0043_587bc2fc271f.jpg\" /></p><p>Vertical velocity of the ball just before each collision is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>app</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi></msqrt></math></p><p>The height up to which the ball bounces after each collision is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>h</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>d</mi></math></p><p>Vertical velocity of the ball just after the collision is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>sep</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>app</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>e</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi></msqrt></math></p><p>Using the principle of conservation of mechanical energy we get</p><p><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>m</mi><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>e</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>d</mi></math></p><p><math><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p>"
  }
